props.description:
The React DOM `style` prop, enhanced with support for `MotionValue`s and separate `transform` values.

```jsx
export const MyComponent = () => {
  const x = useMotionValue(0)

  return <motion.div style={{ x, opacity: 1, scale: 0.5 }} />
}
```

